# Deliberately minimal: in a flake repo, anything ignored here is ALSO invisible
# to `nix build`/`nixos-rebuild`. Never ignore *.nix, flake.lock, or hardware
# configs. See AGENTS.md ("The git gotcha").

# nixos-rebuild / nix build output symlinks
result
result-*

# nix-direnv cache
.direnv/

# VM images from `nixos-rebuild build-vm`
*.qcow2

# Playwright MCP scratch: page snapshots, console logs, and — the reason this
# entry exists — a full copy of anything downloaded through the browser. A 3.1 GB
# Ableton installer landed here and was committed by a `git add -A`, which GitHub
# then refused ("pack exceeds maximum allowed size (2.00 GiB)").
.playwright-mcp/
